design_notes = "Matrix contract: Burst / Spatial / Field State. Poison Puddle specializes the shared StatusSurface system rather than creating its own overlap/status engine. It continuously sustains Poisoned and carries poison/chemical/liquid/surface hazard tags, so the existing reaction resolver can transform it when struck by compatible elements. It does no direct damage by itself."
